"B2","law_id":"kr-004762-227815-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4272,"end":4397,"target_id":"4b1886782be668161208832581007cbd63c6ec5cc107ea704a27e54677d47a06","source_hash":"43029911dc2de8ee3c18d3a0db5ea54e4a90b52bf432a54ad38d3946d19ff180","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。但是，根据补充法令第六条修正的总统令中，修正在本法令生效前已公布但生效日期尚未到来的总统令的部分，应自相关总统令各自的生效日期起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00032","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004762-227815-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4397,"end":4414,"target_id":"6f4f5c85f5c56c54bdd0f8063ad3be189c0afbd4094e9c1c5bb4af1a57603eb9","source_hash":"90d7c234b09875f89ed9e65d48d7911823d8886f04f0ff283113cd913ec46436","text":"省略第 2 至 5 条\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00033","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004762-227815-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4414,"end":4574,"target_id":"3bcfff76c57204cc68fd2ea0f732906b7b722fc9794f009dbd101b9df665edc3","source_hash":"bb65413fa056740ae4b86d78573637d3024d7788d46d3b33d2b72895ba192402","text":"第六条（修改其他法律）①至<84>款省略\n\n  <85> 《前总统礼遇法》实施细则部分内容修订如下。\n\n  在第三条第一款、第二款第一项和第二项、第六条第二款第一项第七节以及第七条第一款和第二款中，“公共行政和安全部长”应改为“安全部长”。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00034","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004762-227815-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4574,"end":4605,"target_id":"c9921b47070e33d47de7ee5d05c05a49f21511d5a6be42424721060591b6f27c","source_hash":"59707c66946669214413020f2f89d65f3124905eab1e0f5fd51f0edbe299d484","text":"  第 8 条中，“公共行政和安全部”应改为“安全保障部”。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00035","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004762-227815-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4605,"end":4667,"target_id":"47f2f8580d17c444e07217750dbcd7c173ad6d57958be433d7d3cf7dae507c55","source_hash":"d11bb4d412134adee2016f1c8dd9c802bbbab60a8a22c67ec1ec3db11a436208","text":"  在所附表格中，“公共行政和安全部长”应改为“安全保障部长”。\n\n  <86> 至 <129> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00036","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004762-227815-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4667,"end":4710,"target_id":"6d466920fe0d71b834ab10e700b04771779042c9ee3624e682a08ad6252c57b2","source_hash":"a3c47358b5319a3ba45787da785dfea890df8d8d79398cc9047d30e04f9d9dac","text":"增编（政府行政和内政部及其附属机构的组织结构）<2014年11月19日第25751号>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00037","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004762-227815-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4710,"end":4835,"target_id":"07354c8f2c0cfcfc64639a554deb85b8e2001d72950bc484324d286baaec0717","source_hash":"ecc5937743f918230a397055273a1cd44275217a8341699c9b3693e458eb6e4c","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。但是，根据补充法令第五条修正的总统令中，修正在本法令生效前已公布但生效日期尚未到来的总统令的部分，应自相关总统令各自的生效日期起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00038","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004762-227815-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4835,"end":4852,"target_id":"f3791df45b0e602737610eca936d0c9adc59e037fbd579020cd8aa7ae6668c48","source_hash":"6ffda08faf109c176be482db4409396ced46b0373db22ad766c9b45cca3b755a","text":"省略第 2 至 4 条\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00039","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004762-227815-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4852,"end":5014,"target_id":"72230d097af4b1da003baecc181d2bb723d3482294f126da2b95c8a1553213ce","source_hash":"a75bbe26a0bbca86ac682c05a155b51f98adaae490d5abe65325f5b161be76a5","text":"第五条（修改其他法律）①至<196>款已省略\n\n  《前总统礼遇法》实施细则部分内容修改如下。\n\n  在第三条第一款、第二款第一项和第二项、第六条第二款第一项第七节以及第七条第一款和第二款中，“安全与公共管理部长”应改为“政府行政与内政部长”。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00040","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004762-227815-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5014,"end":5046,"target_id":"098a97600f1baae5d25f661e4a38444e9b883ca4436b094037bd40019c38400b","source_hash":"1f4bf94451ea7c6281f432d7e8f98af1b0704dd3791a5753596c83e7a7726249","text":"  第 8 条中的“安全与公共管理部”应改为“政府行政与内政部”。 \n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00041","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004762-227815-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5046,"end":5117,"target_id":"cd3226bc991ebb634be5df608ce646f2f424dd3b1cabbd6619b4cc4680a0f342","source_hash":"9a67e9ed3127fe442c2e166d8e1a34384ac6ccb2e240d55dd16e11c669bd7acf","text":"  在所附表格的第 3 页和第 4 页中，“安全与公共管理部长”应改为“政府行政与内政部长”。\n\n  <198> 至 <418> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00042","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004762-227815-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5117,"end":5225,"target_id":"dbed109db16a6d311e5496db4ac47c000da50fc8ea3b0f5dbb28be0288a479d5","source_hash":"c4d7dc7b3fe86a6386dad46bd24062e68eba6477aff72f723aca3be26b5a28c4","text":"增补（关于减少收集居民登记号码的《朝鲜战争阵亡将士遗骸挖掘等法实施细则》的部分修正）<2015年12月30日第26774号>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00043","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004762-227815-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5225,"end":5267,"target_id":"3e28329c0c7d684a2edf0f09cafe4f727976aa2417f7442b014c83a713e76d88","source_hash":"2229ee61688f381fa8791a317dce02e692966c0fc8dfff0224bc44e3cd9315a8","text":"增编（内政安全部及其附属机构的组织结构）<2017年7月26日，第28211号>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00044","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004762-227815-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5267,"end":5392,"target_id":"4b2abb3bb4f5a1ad5392d7552887ba77ed52ce52d63586d0b0ccdda0ec117084","source_hash":"e322c6bccc7dc02efb62fdad6a23702463436edc72b2f2f5029c536f3946505e","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。但是，根据补充法令第八条修正的总统令中，修正在本法令生效前已公布但生效日期尚未到来的总统令的部分，应自相关总统令各自的生效日期起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00045","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004762-227815-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5392,"end":5409,"target_id":"f512e4b41f20ba5462bcd341c63866cea3f9981f7bc1bea714a150917345233c","source_hash":"d9985315e81c5ba7d5516a248b6bd3f949098433ce3c6da60edc74f7499d0a05","text":"省略第 2 至 7 条\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00046","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004762-227815-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5409,"end":5570,"target_id":"a9f72534682d4f6d21929e292beb320072cfefea0bb0f25b0fdb17e4eae16693","source_hash":"568591ca3f4eddd5cd51c10a2be9521a323d86f4356ed1b8b7bcc17407b67a46","text":"第八条（修改其他法律）①至<153>款已省略\n\n  《前总统礼遇法》实施细则部分内容修改如下。\n\n  在第三条第一款、第二款第一项和第二项、第六条第二款第一项第七节以及第七条第一款和第二款中，“政府行政和内政部长”应改为“内政和安全部长”。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00047","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004762-227815-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5570,"end":5610,"target_id":"74ec1ebdcdd5f68dfb721a3506c518f177d92482c68a73fb706b9eeda9c4e2c2","source_hash":"4c5ff4453faa87c8d0050f68fc29e1563a7f33f7399d6c33cf314aa88568db29","text":"  第 8 条中的“政府行政和内政部总账”应改为“内政和安全部总账”。 \n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00048","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004762-227815-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5610,"end":5711,"target_id":"1cfce1aa94f6bbd463fed51adfe4856415d07419f1e445ba3b95b9754414fa00","source_hash":"4675ebdde9d33b31ed1d4b75fe110ee41ef593ee8a21a8c0ade8f31ce322bcbf","text":"  在附件表格第 3 页中，除该表格第 4 页第 2 款和第 3 款所列项目外，其余部分中的“政府行政和内政部长”应改为“内政和安全部长”。\n\n  <155> 至 <388> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00049","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004762-227815-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5711,"end":5762,"target_id":"9cb28d8feb68e7e5312523d300dadba292d0a2b3683486382a2ad47030a1ad51","source_hash":"8cb15e0a6e79b6e9db047119ea65221fbf93915947a3e823cf64f0212ebe59e1","text":"补充规定 <第28300号，2017年9月19日>\n\n本法令自2017年9月22日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00050","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004762-227815-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5762,"end":7538,"target_id":"5119440322f6d146cced2da1a8164e8b389708e3ed19aa7913347559701916d2","source_hash":"431ed15b7d18ba94547b4b0d8a6d761d0cae6f429c2707116e7e03e7a706d581","text":"增补（关于部分修订473项法律以规范复杂法律术语的总统令）<第31380号，2021年1月5日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n根据《前总统待遇法》出具的养老金证明\n■ 《前总统待遇法》实施令[附件]<2021年1月5日修订>（第1页）   \n\n┏━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓\n\n┃                                                                            ┃\n\n┃                                                                            ┃\n\n┃                                                                            ┃\n\n┃                                                                            ┃\n\n┃                                                                            ┃\n\n┃                                                                            ┃\n\n┃                                                                            ┃\n\n┃                                                                            ┃\n\n┃                                                                            ┃\n\n┃                                                                            ┃\n\n┃                                                                            ┃\n\n┃                                                                            ┃\n\n┃                                                                            ┃\n\n┃                                                                  